MODULE: MembershipAccumulatorAtomicShadowKeepsOldSlots
TARGET: MembershipAccumulatorAtomic
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: rebuild installs newly scanned membership with accumulator slots from the retired generation
PERTURBS: InstallRebuild

--- FIND
    /\ members' = shadow /\ counts' = Counts(shadow) /\ sums' = Sums(shadow)
--- REPLACE
    /\ members' = shadow /\ counts' = counts /\ sums' = sums
--- END
